{
  "high_level_description": "Shot on iPhone, an empty physiotherapy treatment room in a small neighborhood clinic on a quiet weekday morning, with a padded vinyl table anchoring the midground, wooden wall bars behind, and soft daylight from a window to the right.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A small physiotherapy treatment room with pale eggshell painted walls and light wood-laminate flooring showing subtle grain and a few faint scuff marks near the table base. A large window on the right wall has thin white blinds half-raised, letting soft diffused daylight spill across the floor and table surface as the only light source, with gentle falloff into the corners. Cool-toned neutral white balance, no warm grade. The walls are bare — no posters, charts, anatomical diagrams, or signage. Deep depth of field with everything in focus, slight phone-camera color rendering, ordinary documentary framing slightly off-center.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Wall-mounted wooden parallel bars running horizontally along the back wall at chest height, occupying the upper-right midground. Pale oak finish with simple steel brackets mounting to the wall, two parallel round bars receding slightly into perspective."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Cluster of colored resistance bands hanging from a single chrome hook on the left side wall, mid-frame. Loops nested together in red, yellow, green, and blue, true saturated colors under cool daylight."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Padded vinyl treatment table anchored slightly left of center in the midground, oriented lengthwise away from camera. White vinyl top with stitched seams, metal frame legs, adjustable crank handle visible on the right side. A folded white cotton towel sits at the head end nearest the camera; a folded grey bath blanket drapes over the far corner."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small wheeled stool tucked beside the right side of the treatment table. Navy vinyl seat on a slim chrome base with five caster wheels, partially visible at the side of the frame."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Black foam roller resting horizontally on the floor near the foot of the table, lower-center of the frame. Cylindrical dense foam with faint dust along its underside where it meets the laminate floor."
      }
    ]
  }
}
